      "text": "There exists <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "WPBVy",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>max</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "P2Nvx",
      "text": "There exist <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>",
